  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### How to set up email templates in Self Assessment\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 23 Aug, 2021 at  3:23 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nSelf Assessment dashboard >> General settings >> Click on the email template that needs to be edited and customise accordingly \n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to set up email templates in Self Assessment\n\nHelp Guide: \n\nFrom the Self Assessment dashboard, use the navigation panel to go into General Settings >> Email Template \n\nSelect the template you want to change and click on Edit. \n\nTo use the template go into a clients dashboard and using the action section from a tax return that has been generated, select Email. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to set up email templates in Self Assessment\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 23 Aug, 2021 at  3:23 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Location:</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Self Assessment dashboard &gt;&gt; General settings &gt;&gt; Click on the email template that needs to be edited and customise accordingly&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><br></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Video Tutorial:</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/456de827efaf46039aeb7c7cc9bc5594\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to set up email templates in Self Assessment</a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Help Guide:&nbsp;</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">From the Self Assessment dashboard, use the navigation panel to go into General Settings &gt;&gt; Email Template&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137620846/original/S4QhOLiAn0NoNA9uJI-9Y9oG9UCX-0OFKQ.png?1629715301\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137620846\"></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Select the template you want to change and click on Edit.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137620882/original/PMoJxxE-NiXcLXKtStFKgcK-scc-sSlNbA.png?1629715349\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137620882\"></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">To use the template go into a clients dashboard and using the action section from a tax return that has been generated, select Email.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137620975/original/1a-XFLs6FEXkYuhOcfc6poL4_M6OtUDtwQ.png?1629715411\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137620975\"></strong><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205617\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205617/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205617\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205617/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remot